  stepId: Step_35_ServiceReport
  instructionText: "LO3.3 - PREPARE AND COMPLETE THE REPORT\n\nDocument the completed
    job on the service report form:\n\n  - Server name and IP configuration\n  -
    Roles installed and the domain created\n  - Accounts, groups and share permissions\n 
    - Printer and folder redirection settings\n  - Result of each of the five tests
    from your test plan\n  - Date, technician name, and supervisor's signature\n\nAn
    undocumented job is an incomplete job - the report is what the client and the
    assessor actually receive.\n\nTap NEXT to see your final score."
